---
// Trust Gateway product screens (user, 2026-11-13): the demo (GatewayDemo) in a dark section right above "관리자는
// 이렇게 봅니다", with the free PoC/consulting button under it. It was the page's hero for a while (TgHero); the page now
// opens with the zero trust band.
// The blueprint film that was the hero before that (GatewayHero + SketchHero) is kept unused in src/components; to bring
// it back as the hero, put <GatewayHero /> first in trust-gateway.astro, re-add the Nanum Pen Script font link in its
// head slot, and give the zero trust band back its h2 (drop "first").
import GatewayDemo from '../GatewayDemo.astro';
---
<section class="section night" id="demo">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="head-center reveal">
      <h2 class="h2">제품 화면으로 보기</h2>
    </div>
    <GatewayDemo />
    <div class="td-cta"><a class="btn primary" href="/contact?type=poc">무료 PoC/컨설팅 신청</a></div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .td-cta { margin-top: clamp(24px, 3vw, 32px); display: flex; justify-content: center; }
</style>
